<p>Throw a cloud of blinding dust in a radius <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 1, 1, 2, 2</acronym> cone. Enemies within will be blinded, as well as having their accuracy reduced by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">8, 13, 17, 21, 24</acronym> and movement speed decreased by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">29%, 44%, 54%, 60%, 64%</acronym> for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">3, 3, 4, 4, 5</acronym> turns.</p><p>The chance to inflict these effects increase with your Accuracy.</p>